    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14583" root="ربق" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبِيقٌ</span></b> , (TA,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبِيقَةٌ</span>, (S, Msb, K,) applied to a
lamb or kid (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهْمَة</span>), (ISk, S, K,) or to a sheep or
goat (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاة</span>), (Msb, TA,) <i>Having its head put into
the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِبْقَة</span>; (ISk, S, Msb, K, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْبُوقَةٌ</span></b> 
(ISk, JK, S, Msb, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرَبَّقَةٌ</span></b> . (JK, TA.)

